# about.html

msgid "about_title"
msgstr "About Us"

msgid "about_hero_title"
msgstr "Agrosector – the intersection of science and business"

msgid "about_hero_subtitle"
msgstr "We have united scientific developments, training courses and expert support on one platform"

msgid "who_we_are_title"
msgstr "Who We Are?"

msgid "who_we_are_p1"
msgstr "Agrosector is a leading Kazakhstani platform that combines science, education and practical application in agriculture."

msgid "who_we_are_p2"
msgstr "We have created a unique ecosystem where farmers, agronomists, veterinarians and researchers can share experiences, gain relevant knowledge and develop their business."

msgid "who_we_are_p3"
msgstr "Our team consists of experienced specialists with many years of experience in various agricultural sectors who understand the real needs of the agricultural complex."

msgid "who_we_are_p4"
msgstr "Over the years, we have helped hundreds of companies increase production efficiency, implement modern technologies and achieve sustainable development."

msgid "our_purpose_title"
msgstr "Our Purpose"

msgid "our_purpose_p1"
msgstr "Modernization of Kazakhstani agriculture through the introduction of innovative technologies, scientific developments and modern management methods."

msgid "our_purpose_p2"
msgstr "We strive to make the agricultural sector more productive, sustainable and competitive at the international level."

msgid "our_purpose_p3"
msgstr "Our goal is to create a digital ecosystem that will unite all participants in the agricultural complex and provide them with access to best practices, technologies and knowledge."

msgid "our_purpose_p4"
msgstr "We believe that only through combining the efforts of science, business and government can revolutionary changes in agriculture be achieved."

msgid "our_mission_title"
msgstr "Our Mission"

msgid "our_mission_p1"
msgstr "To ensure sustainable development of Kazakhstan's agriculture through the integration of scientific achievements, modern technologies and best world practices."

msgid "our_mission_p2"
msgstr "We provide comprehensive solutions for agribusiness: from research and laboratory analysis to educational programs and consulting services."

msgid "our_mission_p3"
msgstr "Our mission includes supporting small and medium-sized farms, helping them master new technologies and methods of agriculture."

msgid "our_mission_p4"
msgstr "We strive to create conditions for the growth of the country's food security and increase the competitiveness of Kazakhstani agricultural products in world markets."

msgid "our_team_title"
msgstr "Our Team"

msgid "our_team_description"
msgstr "Professionals with many years of experience in the agricultural complex, ready to share knowledge and help develop your business."

