# Agrotechnopark about texts
msgid "about_text_1"
msgstr "The Agrotechnopark of Shakarim University is a modern scientific and educational complex specializing in the development of innovative technologies in agriculture, veterinary medicine, and food safety."

msgid "about_text_2"
msgstr "Our center brings together advanced laboratories, a veterinary clinic, and research departments equipped with modern diagnostic and analytical equipment. We provide a full range of services from laboratory analysis to veterinary care."

msgid "about_text_3"
msgstr "The Agrotechnopark serves as a platform for student practical training, scientific research, and professional services to the regional agrarian sector, contributing to the development of modern and safe agriculture."

# Engineering center about texts
msgid "eng_about_text_1"
msgstr "The Engineering Center offers a wide range of services for strengthening and restoring machine parts, modeling, and implementing modern technical solutions for various industries. Engineering services aim to increase productivity and techno-economic efficiency of mechanical engineering enterprises."

msgid "eng_about_text_2"
msgstr "We specialize in the full range of engineering tasks: from technical documentation and risk analysis to project management and implementation of innovative technologies. Our team of professional engineers and designers ensures high-quality work delivery on time."

msgid "eng_about_text_3"
msgstr "Main areas of activity include: design and calculations, production process optimization, software development."

# Lab about texts
msgid "lab_about_text_1"
msgstr "Shakarim Lab is a leading research center specializing in modern analytical and research methods in agriculture, ecology, and industry."

msgid "lab_about_text_2"
msgstr "Our center is equipped with high-tech instruments and staffed with qualified specialists, enabling a wide range of laboratory tests and analyses at the international level."

msgid "lab_about_text_3"
msgstr "We provide services for both scientific institutions and universities, as well as commercial organizations aiming for innovation and product quality improvement."

# Engineering services
