# Laboratory titles and descriptions
msgid "lab_food_safety_title"
msgstr "Laboratory of Biological and Food Safety"

msgid "lab_food_safety_description"
msgstr "A modern laboratory for comprehensive analysis of food products and biological materials for safety and quality. We conduct microbiological research, detection of pathogenic microorganisms, analysis of pesticide, antibiotic, and other harmful substance content. The lab is equipped with high-precision equipment to ensure quality control of food products in accordance with international standards."

msgid "veterinary_clinic_title"
msgstr "Veterinary Clinic"

msgid "veterinary_clinic_description"
msgstr "A modern veterinary clinic providing a full range of services for farm and domestic animals. We perform diagnostics, treatment, disease prevention, vaccination, and surgeries. The clinic is equipped with modern diagnostic tools including X-ray, ultrasound, and lab equipment for express tests. Our specialists offer high-quality veterinary care and consultations on animal keeping."

msgid "milk_analysis_lab_title"
msgstr "Milk Analysis Laboratory"

msgid "milk_analysis_lab_description"
msgstr "A specialized laboratory offering a full range of analyses for milk and dairy products. We determine physicochemical parameters, fat, protein, lactose, and somatic cell content. We conduct microbiological control, antibiotic, and inhibitor testing. The lab is equipped with modern milk analyzers and complies with dairy quality standards."

msgid "plasma_lab_title"
msgstr "Plasma Surface Treatment Technologies Laboratory"

msgid "plasma_lab_description"
msgstr "A specialized lab focused on developing and applying plasma technologies for material surface modification. We perform plasma spraying, ion-plasma treatment, and protective coating creation. The lab is equipped with modern plasma systems to enhance mechanical, chemical, and physical properties of materials for industrial and research purposes."

msgid "materials_lab_title"
msgstr "Materials Science and Electrolyte-Plasma Technologies Laboratory"

msgid "materials_lab_description"
msgstr "A research laboratory specializing in material property studies and application of electrolyte-plasma technologies. We analyze structures and properties of metals, alloys, ceramics, and composites. We develop new methods of electrolyte-plasma oxidation to create functional coatings with specific properties. Equipped with advanced analytical instruments for a full cycle of materials science research."

msgid "testing_lab_title"
msgstr "Testing Laboratory (Soil, Feed)"

msgid "testing_lab_description"
msgstr "A modern testing lab specializing in comprehensive soil and feed analysis. We study soil fertility, nutrient content, and analyze the quality and safety of animal feed. The lab is equipped with high-precision analytical equipment for chemical, physical, and microbiological research."

msgid "collective_lab_title"
msgstr "Shared Research Laboratory"

msgid "collective_lab_description"
msgstr "A multifunctional shared research laboratory providing a wide range of analytical services for research projects. It includes modern equipment for spectral analysis, chromatography, microscopy, and other research methods. The lab serves both internal scientific projects and external requests from universities and commercial organizations."

